# An instance of a class whose parent is one of several has room for the fields of each. What a private name answers does not go by the room: the instance has the names of the parent that its class has, and no other's.
# RUN: run-in-shell
# CHECK: 2700
# CHECK-NEXT: 3 0 7 TypeError undefined stored shown,extra node
# CHECK-NEXT: 0 3 TypeError leaf TypeError TypeError shown,extra leaf
# CHECK-NEXT: 3 0 7 TypeError undefined stored shown,extra node
# CHECK-NEXT: 3 0 7 TypeError undefined stored shown node
# CHECK-NEXT: 0 3 TypeError leaf TypeError TypeError shown leaf
# CHECK-NEXT: exited with 0
